sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P1 as Player 1 (Client)
    actor P2 as Player 2 (Client)
    participant API as ASP.NET API
    participant GS as Godot Server (Headless)

    Note over P1, P2: Phase 1: Authentication
    P1->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API-->>P1: Return JWT Token
    P2->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API-->>P2: Return JWT Token

    Note over P1, P2: Phase 2: Match Request
    P1->>API: SignalR: JoinQueue(JWT)
    API->>API: Add P1 to Queue
    P2->>API: SignalR: JoinQueue(JWT)
    API->>API: Queue.Count >= 2? YES!

    Note over API, GS: Phase 3: Spinning up Server
    API->>GS: OS.Execute("./GodotServer --match-id=123")
    GS->>GS: Initialize ENet Server (Port 8910)
    GS-->>API: HTTP POST /api/match/ready (I am open!)

    Note over P1, GS: Phase 4: Connection
    API->>P1: SignalR: MatchFound(IP: 127.0.0.1, Port: 8910, Role: DEFENDER)
    API->>P2: SignalR: MatchFound(IP: 127.0.0.1, Port: 8910, Role: ATTACKER)

    P1->>GS: ENet Connect()
    P2->>GS: ENet Connect()
    
    GS->>P1: RPC: GameStart()
    GS->>P2: RPC: GameStart()
